{"seq":1,"slug":"authentication-at-gateway","title":"网关层认证机制：集中化身份验证的实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security/authentication-at-gateway","wordCount":773,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"网关层认证机制-集中化身份验证的实现\">网关层认证机制：集中化身份验证的实现</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>认证（Authentication）</strong></td>\n<td>验证调用方&quot;是谁&quot;——证明身份</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>授权（Authorization）</strong></td>\n<td>决定调用方&quot;能做什么&quot;——权限检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>JWT（JSON Web Token）</strong></td>\n<td>自包含的签名令牌，网关可在本地验证，无需查询数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>OAuth 2.0 Introspection</strong></td>\n<td>向授权服务器查询 Access Token 是否有效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Lambda Authorizer</strong></td>\n<td>AWS API Gateway 的自定义认证器，用 Lambda 函数实现任意认证逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"认证的集中化价值\">认证的集中化价值</h2><p>将认证放在网关的核心理由：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>单一执行点</strong>：所有进入系统的请求都经过同一个认证检查，不存在&quot;某个服务忘记加认证&quot;的漏洞</li>\n<li><strong>下游信任简化</strong>：网关验证完毕后，将用户身份注入 Header，下游服务信任网关，无需重复验证 JWT</li>\n<li><strong>认证策略统一变更</strong>：要从 JWT 切换到 OAuth 2.0，只改网关层配置，服务代码无需动</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"jwt-验证\">JWT 验证</h2><p>JWT 是最常见的 API 认证令牌。网关验证 JWT 的流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1. 提取 Token（Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;）&#10;2. 解码 Header（算法）+ Payload（claims）&#10;3. 根据 kid（Key ID）获取对应公钥（从 JWKS Endpoint 缓存）&#10;4. 验证签名&#10;5. 验证 exp（过期时间）、iss（颁发者）、aud（受众）&#10;6. 提取 sub（用户 ID）、roles 等 claim&#10;7. 注入到请求 Header 转发给下游\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1. 提取 Token（Authorization: Bearer &#x3C;token>）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 解码 Header（算法）+ Payload（claims）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 根据 kid（Key ID）获取对应公钥（从 JWKS Endpoint 缓存）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 验证签名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>5. 验证 exp（过期时间）、iss（颁发者）、aud（受众）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>6. 提取 sub（用户 ID）、roles 等 claim</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>7. 注入到请求 Header 转发给下游</span></span></code></pre></div><p>网关缓存 JWKS（JSON Web Key Set）公钥，避免每次请求都去授权服务器取公钥：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 伪代码：网关 JWT 验证&#10;type JWTValidator struct {&#10;    jwksURL    string&#10;    cache      *JWKSCache // 本地公钥缓存，TTL = 1 小时&#10;    issuer     string&#10;    audience   string&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (v *JWTValidator) Validate(tokenStr string) (*Claims, error) {&#10;    // 1. 解析 JWT Header 拿到 kid&#10;    kid, alg, err := parseHeader(tokenStr)&#10;&#10;    // 2. 从缓存获取公钥（缺失时从 JWKS Endpoint 拉取）&#10;    pubKey, err := v.cache.Get(kid, v.jwksURL)&#10;&#10;    // 3. 验证签名&#10;    claims, err := jwt.ParseWithClaims(tokenStr, &amp;Claims{}, func(t *jwt.Token) (any, error) {&#10;        if t.Method.Alg() != alg {&#10;            return nil, ErrUnexpectedAlg&#10;        }&#10;        return pubKey, nil&#10;    })&#10;&#10;    // 4. 验证标准 claims&#10;    if !claims.VerifyExpiresAt(time.Now(), true) {&#10;        return nil, ErrTokenExpired&#10;    }&#10;    if !claims.VerifyIssuer(v.issuer, true) {&#10;        return nil, ErrInvalidIssuer&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    return claims, nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 伪代码：网关 JWT 验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JWTValidator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    jwksURL    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cache      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">JWKSCache</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 本地公钥缓存，TTL = 1 小时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    issuer     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    audience   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">JWTValidator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Validate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tokenStr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Claims</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 1. 解析 JWT Header 拿到 kid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    kid, alg, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseHeader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tokenStr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 2. 从缓存获取公钥（缺失时从 JWKS Endpoint 拉取）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pubKey, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v.cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(kid, v.jwksURL)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 3. 验证签名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    claims, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jwt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ParseWithClaims</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tokenStr, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Claims</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jwt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Token</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t.Method.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Alg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alg {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ErrUnexpectedAlg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pubKey, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 4. 验证标准 claims</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">claims.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">VerifyExpiresAt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ErrTokenExpired</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">claims.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">VerifyIssuer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v.issuer, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ErrInvalidIssuer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> claims, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"jwt-验证的边界\">JWT 验证的边界</h3><p>网关做 JWT 验证存在一个局限：JWT 是<strong>无状态</strong>的，网关无法知道 Token 是否已被吊销（用户退出登录、账号被封禁）。解决方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>短 TTL</strong>（15 分钟）+ Refresh Token：即使 Token 泄露，有效期短，损失有限</li>\n<li><strong>Deny List</strong>（拒绝列表）：Token 吊销时将 jti（Token ID）写入 Redis，网关每次验证后查一次</li>\n<li><strong>Token Introspection</strong>：每次请求都查询授权服务器（实时准确，但有额外延迟）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"api-key-认证\">API Key 认证</h2><p>API Key 适合机器对机器（M2M）场景，例如第三方系统调用你的 API：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"GET /api/v1/data&#10;X-API-Key: ak_prod_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>GET /api/v1/data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-API-Key: ak_prod_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx</span></span></code></pre></div><p>网关验证 API Key 的逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1. 提取 Header 中的 API Key&#10;2. 查 Redis：GET api_key:{key_hash} → {consumer_id, rate_limit, allowed_paths}&#10;3. 验证 Key 是否存在、是否被吊销&#10;4. 检查请求路径是否在 allowed_paths 内&#10;5. 触发限流计数（按 consumer_id）&#10;6. 注入 X-Consumer-ID Header\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1. 提取 Header 中的 API Key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 查 Redis：GET api_key:{key_hash} → {consumer_id, rate_limit, allowed_paths}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 验证 Key 是否存在、是否被吊销</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 检查请求路径是否在 allowed_paths 内</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>5. 触发限流计数（按 consumer_id）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>6. 注入 X-Consumer-ID Header</span></span></code></pre></div><p>API Key 应该哈希存储（SHA-256），即使数据库泄露也无法使用原始 Key。</p>\n<h2 id=\"oauth-2-0-集成\">OAuth 2.0 集成</h2><p>当系统使用 OAuth 2.0 授权框架时，网关作为 OAuth 资源服务器（Resource Server）验证 Access Token。</p>\n<h3 id=\"introspection-模式\">Introspection 模式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant GW as API Gateway&#10;    participant AS as 授权服务器&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;GW: 请求 + Access Token&#10;    GW-&gt;&gt;AS: POST /oauth/introspect {token}&#10;    AS--&gt;&gt;GW: {active: true, sub: &quot;user123&quot;, scope: &quot;read write&quot;}&#10;    GW-&gt;&gt;GW: 缓存结果(TTL=60s)&#10;    GW--&gt;&gt;C: 转发到后端服务\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant GW as API Gateway\n    participant AS as 授权服务器\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;GW: 请求 + Access Token\n    GW-&gt;&gt;AS: POST /oauth/introspect {token}\n    AS--&gt;&gt;GW: {active: true, sub: \"user123\", scope: \"read write\"}\n    GW-&gt;&gt;GW: 缓存结果(TTL=60s)\n    GW--&gt;&gt;C: 转发到后端服务</pre><p>Introspection 每次都查询授权服务器，准确但慢。通过短时缓存（60 秒）减少延迟。</p>\n<h3 id=\"jwt-access-token-模式-推荐\">JWT Access Token 模式（推荐）</h3><p>现代 OAuth 服务器颁发 JWT 格式的 Access Token，网关本地验证，无需远程查询：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Access Token（JWT 格式）&#10;  Header: {alg: RS256, kid: &quot;key-2024-01&quot;}&#10;  Payload: {sub: &quot;user123&quot;, scope: &quot;read write&quot;, iss: &quot;auth.example.com&quot;, exp: ...}&#10;  Signature: ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Access Token（JWT 格式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Header: {alg: RS256, kid: \"key-2024-01\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Payload: {sub: \"user123\", scope: \"read write\", iss: \"auth.example.com\", exp: ...}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Signature: ...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>网关用授权服务器的公钥（从 JWKS Endpoint 获取）本地验证签名，性能最优。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多种认证方式并存\">多种认证方式并存</h2><p>生产网关通常需要同时支持多种认证方式（用户 JWT、服务账号 API Key、第三方 OAuth），用认证链处理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"认证链（有序，第一个成功即通过）:&#10;  1. 检查是否有 Authorization: Bearer → JWT 验证&#10;  2. 检查是否有 X-API-Key → API Key 验证&#10;  3. 检查是否有 Cookie session → Session 验证&#10;  4. 全部失败 → 401 Unauthorized\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>认证链（有序，第一个成功即通过）:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. 检查是否有 Authorization: Bearer → JWT 验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. 检查是否有 X-API-Key → API Key 验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. 检查是否有 Cookie session → Session 验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  4. 全部失败 → 401 Unauthorized</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>网关层认证通过集中化消除了各服务重复实现的安全风险。JWT 本地验证（配合 JWKS 缓存）是性能最优的方案，但需要解决令牌吊销问题；API Key 适合 M2M 场景；OAuth Introspection 最准确但有额外延迟。认证完成后，网关将身份信息注入 Header，下游服务信任网关、无需重复验证。授权决策（能否访问特定资源）见下一篇<a href=\"authorization-access-control\">授权与访问控制</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网关层认证机制：集中化身份验证的实现","id":"网关层认证机制-集中化身份验证的实现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"认证的集中化价值","id":"认证的集中化价值"},{"level":2,"text":"JWT 验证","id":"jwt-验证"},{"level":3,"text":"JWT 验证的边界","id":"jwt-验证的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"API Key 认证","id":"api-key-认证"},{"level":2,"text":"OAuth 2.0 集成","id":"oauth-2-0-集成"},{"level":3,"text":"Introspection 模式","id":"introspection-模式"},{"level":3,"text":"JWT Access Token 模式（推荐）","id":"jwt-access-token-模式-推荐"},{"level":2,"text":"多种认证方式并存","id":"多种认证方式并存"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"协议转换与请求变换：网关如何做格式桥接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/fundamentals/protocol-transformation"},"next":{"title":"授权与访问控制：网关如何决定\"能做什么\"","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security/authorization-access-control"}}